sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Browser
    participant Ctrl as ImageController
    participant Search as ImageSearchService
    participant Repo as ImageRepository
    participant SQLite

    Browser->>Ctrl: GET /
    Ctrl->>Search: count()
    Search->>Repo: count()
    Repo->>SQLite: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM images
    Ctrl-->>Browser: index.html (Thymeleaf, totalImages)

    Note over Browser: hx-trigger="load" on #grid
    Browser->>Ctrl: GET /search?q=&page=0
    Ctrl->>Search: search("", 0)
    Search->>Repo: findAll(offset=0, limit=30)
    Repo->>SQLite: SELECT ... ORDER BY i.id LIMIT 30 OFFSET 0
    Repo-->>Search: List~ImageSummary~
    Search-->>Ctrl: List~ImageSummary~
    Ctrl-->>Browser: HTML cards (img src=/thumbnail/{id}, hx-get modal)<br/>+ load-more div if size==30

    Note over Browser: user types in #search-input<br/>(keyup changed delay:300ms)
    Browser->>Ctrl: GET /search?q=birthday&page=0
    Ctrl->>Search: search("birthday", 0)
    Search->>Repo: search("birthday", 0, 30)
    Repo->>SQLite: SELECT ... FROM images_fts<br/>WHERE images_fts MATCH 'birthday*'<br/>ORDER BY rank LIMIT 30 OFFSET 0
    Repo-->>Ctrl: List~ImageSummary~ (or empty -> "No images found.")

    Note over Browser: scrolling reveals load-more div<br/>(hx-trigger="revealed")
    Browser->>Ctrl: GET /search?q=birthday&page=1
    Ctrl->>Search: search("birthday", 1)
    Note right of Search: offset = page * pageSize = 30
